<section class="redemption" id="redemption">
  <div class="redemption__inner">
    <div class="redemption__media">
      {% img "guitars/redemption", "Redemption Series guitar, full length, its reclaimed wood body showing deep grain, cracks and character", "(min-width: 960px) 50vw, 100vw" %}
    </div>
    <div class="redemption__body">
      <p class="eyebrow">II. The Redemption Series</p>
      <h2 class="h2 h2--big">Look <em>again.</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">Where others see something imperfect, overlooked or disposable, we look again. There may still be beauty written into it.</p>
      <div class="redemption__quote">
        <p class="pull">We don't manufacture imperfections. We don't invent a story. We work with the story already there.</p>
        <p>Every Redemption guitar is one of one. It exists only when the right material is found — so there's no waitlist to join, just a conversation to start.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="#inquire">Ask what's on the bench</a>
        <a class="btn btn--text" href="/instruments/redemption/">The Redemption Series →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
